    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22134" root="شرع" body-key="$">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلَانٌ يَشْتَرِعُ شِرْعَتَهُ</span></b>  [meaning <i>Such a one
originates,</i> or <i>embraces,</i> or <i>follows, his way of
religion</i>] is similar to the phrases <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَفْتَطِرُ فِطْرَتَهُ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَمْتَلُّ مِلَّتَهُ</span>; from <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِرْعَةُ الدِّينِ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِطْرَتُهُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِلَّتُهُ</span>.
(TA.)

